
target/
# Written at build time by .github/scripts/docs/build-docs.sh, which owns the filter's text
# so its sibling scripts cannot drift from it. It is a build product like anything under
# target/, and only lands outside it because the scripts pass pandoc this path.
scripts/md-to-html-links.lua
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/

